#indent 4

//: # type_resolver
//: NEPLg2.1 self-host compiler の type prefix resolver [入口/いりぐち]
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - parser が保持した `%` type annotation range を、kind-directed type application reduction の入力へ変換します。
//: - この facade は公開 API の入口だけを re-export し、実装は `type_resolver/*` に分けます。
//:
//: [注意/ちゅうい]:
//: - parser / reducer の primary boundary は flat prefix item と TypeId 割当前の resolved type tree です。
//: - projection API は resolved type tree を `SelfhostTypeArena` へ投影します。named type は constructor table を渡す API でだけ受理します。
//: - `void` は 0 引数 function marker として扱い、type arena の primitive には追加しません。
//:
//: neplg2:test
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "neplg2/core/resolve/type_resolver" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     selfhost_type_resolver_stage0
//: ```

pub #import "./type_resolver/model" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/input" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/constructor" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/resolved/id" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/resolved/kind" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/resolved/named" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/resolved" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/reduce/model" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/reduce/plan" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/reduce/build" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/reduce" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/project" as *
pub #import "./type_resolver/stage0" as *
